# Explain

Read relevant files and trace the execution or data flow. Explain at the user's level, cite relevant locations and separate observed facts from inference. Use a short example where helpful. Treat explanation requests as read-only unless changes are requested.

Examples: explain an authentication flow; describe how a module handles failures. If the code is unavailable, identify the missing evidence and avoid inventing APIs.
